      "text": "SECTION  1.  ACCELERATION  OF  INCOME  TAX  BENEFITS  FOR  CHARITABLE  CASH  CONTRIBUTIONS  FOR  RELIEF  OF  INDIAN OCEAN TSUNAMI VICTIMS.",
