      "orig": "(b)  CONTRIBUTION DESCRIBED.-A  contribution  is  described  in this  subsection  if  such  contribution  is  a  cash  contribution  made for  the  relief  of  victims  in  areas  affected  by  the  December  26, 2004,  Indian  Ocean  tsunami  for  which  a  charitable  contribution deduction  is  allowable  under  section  170  of  the  Internal  Revenue Code of 1986.",
      "text": "(b)  CONTRIBUTION DESCRIBED.-A  contribution  is  described  in this  subsection  if  such  contribution  is  a  cash  contribution  made for  the  relief  of  victims  in  areas  affected  by  the  December  26, 2004,  Indian  Ocean  tsunami  for  which  a  charitable  contribution deduction  is  allowable  under  section  170  of  the  Internal  Revenue Code of 1986."
